    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116280" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠοτοκ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lay eggs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				566b1
			</span></i>, etc.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκωληκοτοκέω</span>
			and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωοτοκέω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1256b13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				732a28
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ᾠοτοκοῦντα</span>
			<i>oviparous</i> animals, ib. <i><span class="en">
				749a17
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be produced as eggs,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ᾠοτοκούμενα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				746a27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of plants,
				<i>produce seed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				79
			</span></i>.</div>
